WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.220
But give the Dems some credit,

00:00:01.220 --> 00:00:03.100
at least they're finally recognizing

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:05.120
that their typical male supporter

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:08.480
is a smelly life support system for a man bun.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:11.680
I mean, you know you're in trouble

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:14.440
when your Rambo is Beto O'Rourke.

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:19.440
And if this is your party's answer to Clint Eastwood,

00:00:25.799 --> 00:00:28.799
no wonder Democrat men start menstruating.

00:00:29.639 --> 00:00:32.919
And this is your action hero?

00:00:32.919 --> 00:00:36.520
He banged the first girl who ever talked to him.

00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:38.680
And she did it because she was a spy.

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:43.240
Now, it's good they're hitting the gym,

00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:46.560
but we do it for ourselves, not for political advantage.

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:47.919
There's a difference there.

00:00:47.919 --> 00:00:50.119
Republicans go because we like work,

00:00:50.119 --> 00:00:51.880
we like strength, we like winning,

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:54.959
we like women doing lunges and Lululemons.

00:00:54.959 --> 00:00:59.919
And look, I mean, look at me.

00:00:59.919 --> 00:01:03.259
You think all this happens without hours at the gym?

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:07.559
Shout out to my personal trainer, it's Seth.

00:01:07.559 --> 00:01:09.760
Yeah, don't wait up.

